[2026-03-16T04:01:03.828Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015gnvCPVRMwFHcqNtBbjseH","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a summary of all the findings:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully located the Airbnb Clone app and gathered all requested information. Here are the key findings:\n\n### App Location\nThe airbnb-clone app is located at: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 1. Documentation Files Read\n\n**plan.md** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md`)\n- Shows the project polish checklist with accessibility and responsive UI status\n- MyTrips page has accessibility completed but responsive UI is still pending\n\n**tests.md** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`)\n- Comprehensive test specifications document (1380 lines)\n- Contains detailed test cases for all pages including MyTrips (lines 607-752)\n- MyTrips page has 3 main components: TripsTabs, TripCard, and CancelBookingDialog\n\n### 2. MyTrips Page Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx` (60 lines)\n\nThe MyTrips page is a protected route that:\n- Redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- Fetches user bookings on mount using `fetchUserBookings` from Redux\n- Manages cancel dialog state with a `CancelBookingDialog` component\n- Uses accessibility features with `aria-live=\"polite\"` for dynamic content updates\n- Shows a loading state while fetching bookings\n\n### 3. Related Components (Trips/Bookings Specific)\n\n**TripsTabs** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` - 128 lines)\n- Manages three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- Filters bookings based on status and check-in date\n- Implements keyboard navigation (ArrowRight, ArrowLeft, Home, End)\n- Full ARIA attributes for accessibility (role=\"tablist\", role=\"tab\", role=\"tabpanel\")\n- Shows empty state messages for each tab\n\n**TripCard** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx` - 128 lines)\n- Displays individual trip information with property image, title, location, dates\n- Status badge with color coding (pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed)\n- Cancel button (for pending/confirmed bookings)\n- Write Review button (for completed bookings without reviews)\n- Reviewed badge (for completed bookings with reviews)\n- Navigates to property detail page on card click\n- Proper event handling to prevent propagation on action buttons\n\n**CancelBookingDialog** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx` - 98 lines)\n- Modal dialog for confirming booking cancellation\n- Shows property name and dates for context\n- Implements focus management and keyboard trap (Escape key support)\n- Tab cycling support within dialog\n- Two action buttons: \"Keep Booking\" and \"Yes, Cancel\"\n\n**BookingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` - 246 lines)\n- Table-based component for host dashboard bookings management\n- Filter buttons for status (All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed)\n- Confirm and Cancel actions for pending bookings\n- Built-in cancel dialog with keyboard accessibility\n- Similar styling and UX patterns to TripCard\n\n**PropertyBookingContext** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyBookingContext.tsx` - 67 lines)\n- Used in review form to display booking context\n- Shows property image, title, location, dates, guest count, and total price\n- Calculates number of nights for display\n\n### 4. App Styling\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css` (294 lines)\n\nContains:\n- Tailwind CSS import with custom theme variables\n- Airbnb color palette (primary #FF385C, secondary colors)\n- Status colors (pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed)\n- Layout styles for app structure (header, main, footer)\n- Header navigation styling with active state underline\n- Footer grid layout\n- Responsive media queries for mobile/tablet\n\n### File Paths Summary\n\n- **My Trips Page:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n- **TripsTabs Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n- **TripCard Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n- **CancelBookingDialog Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n- **BookingsTab Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`\n- **PropertyBookingContext Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyBookingContext.tsx`\n- **App Stylesheet:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\n- **Documentation Plan:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md`\n- **Documentation Tests:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a8fe80d0d4e371efb (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 49790\ntool_uses: 20\nduration_ms: 30810</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8726d00c-8026-4c68-978a-d437b7ce1755","uuid":"b6e17d14-69c9-42e0-930b-21a8f28332a8","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the airbnb-clone app in /repo/apps/. I need to:\n1. Read docs/plan.md in the app directory\n2. Read docs/tests.md in the app directory\n3. Find the My Trips page component and all related components\n4. Find index.css for the app\n\nSearch thoroughly - check /repo/apps/ for any airbnb-related directory. Read the My Trips page component fully and any components it imports that are specific to trips/bookings.","agentId":"a8fe80d0d4e371efb","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now let me create a summary of all the findings:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully located the Airbnb Clone app and gathered all requested information. Here are the key findings:\n\n### App Location\nThe airbnb-clone app is located at: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone`\n\n### 1. Documentation Files Read\n\n**plan.md** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md`)\n- Shows the project polish checklist with accessibility and responsive UI status\n- MyTrips page has accessibility completed but responsive UI is still pending\n\n**tests.md** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`)\n- Comprehensive test specifications document (1380 lines)\n- Contains detailed test cases for all pages including MyTrips (lines 607-752)\n- MyTrips page has 3 main components: TripsTabs, TripCard, and CancelBookingDialog\n\n### 2. MyTrips Page Component\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx` (60 lines)\n\nThe MyTrips page is a protected route that:\n- Redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- Fetches user bookings on mount using `fetchUserBookings` from Redux\n- Manages cancel dialog state with a `CancelBookingDialog` component\n- Uses accessibility features with `aria-live=\"polite\"` for dynamic content updates\n- Shows a loading state while fetching bookings\n\n### 3. Related Components (Trips/Bookings Specific)\n\n**TripsTabs** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` - 128 lines)\n- Manages three tabs: Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n- Filters bookings based on status and check-in date\n- Implements keyboard navigation (ArrowRight, ArrowLeft, Home, End)\n- Full ARIA attributes for accessibility (role=\"tablist\", role=\"tab\", role=\"tabpanel\")\n- Shows empty state messages for each tab\n\n**TripCard** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx` - 128 lines)\n- Displays individual trip information with property image, title, location, dates\n- Status badge with color coding (pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed)\n- Cancel button (for pending/confirmed bookings)\n- Write Review button (for completed bookings without reviews)\n- Reviewed badge (for completed bookings with reviews)\n- Navigates to property detail page on card click\n- Proper event handling to prevent propagation on action buttons\n\n**CancelBookingDialog** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx` - 98 lines)\n- Modal dialog for confirming booking cancellation\n- Shows property name and dates for context\n- Implements focus management and keyboard trap (Escape key support)\n- Tab cycling support within dialog\n- Two action buttons: \"Keep Booking\" and \"Yes, Cancel\"\n\n**BookingsTab** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` - 246 lines)\n- Table-based component for host dashboard bookings management\n- Filter buttons for status (All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed)\n- Confirm and Cancel actions for pending bookings\n- Built-in cancel dialog with keyboard accessibility\n- Similar styling and UX patterns to TripCard\n\n**PropertyBookingContext** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyBookingContext.tsx` - 67 lines)\n- Used in review form to display booking context\n- Shows property image, title, location, dates, guest count, and total price\n- Calculates number of nights for display\n\n### 4. App Styling\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css` (294 lines)\n\nContains:\n- Tailwind CSS import with custom theme variables\n- Airbnb color palette (primary #FF385C, secondary colors)\n- Status colors (pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed)\n- Layout styles for app structure (header, main, footer)\n- Header navigation styling with active state underline\n- Footer grid layout\n- Responsive media queries for mobile/tablet\n\n### File Paths Summary\n\n- **My Trips Page:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n- **TripsTabs Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n- **TripCard Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n- **CancelBookingDialog Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n- **BookingsTab Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`\n- **PropertyBookingContext Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/PropertyBookingContext.tsx`\n- **App Stylesheet:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\n- **Documentation Plan:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md`\n- **Documentation Tests:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`"}],"